# `useBomManagedVersions` replaces every dependency version pinned by a visible BOM (own group +
# common-settings) with `*` — version markers included — and leaves unpinned lines, BOM coordinates and
# already-`*` lines untouched. Running it at the root aggregates over every project group.
> useBomManagedVersions
> assertBomManaged
> reload
> compile
